<%# 3.1 "How it works" — illustrated vertical steps (design booklet page 29) %>
<div class="homepage-how-it-works" id="learn-more">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="hiw-content__headings">
      <h2><%= _("How it works") %></h2>
      <p class="hiw__subtitle">
        <%= _("You have the <strong>right</strong> to request information from publicly-funded bodies and get answers. {{site_name}} helps you make a request for public records and publishes the requests online.", :site_name => site_name) %>
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="hiw-steps">
      <li class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-step__illustration" aria-hidden="true">
          <%= image_tag "illustrations/undraw_fill-forms.svg", alt: "" %>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-step__content">
          <h3 class="hiw-step__title"><span class="hiw-step__num">1.</span> <%= _("Make a request") %></h3>
          <p><%= _("Easily create a request by filling in your case. We have created a template where you only need to state which documents you want access to. The request is sent to the chosen authority by email, which they must respond to within a few weeks.") %></p>
          <%= link_to _("Make a request"), select_authority_path, class: "link_button_green" %>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw-step hiw-step--reverse">
        <div class="hiw-step__illustration" aria-hidden="true">
          <%= image_tag "illustrations/undraw_mail-sent.svg", alt: "" %>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-step__content">
          <h3 class="hiw-step__title"><span class="hiw-step__num">2.</span> <%= _("Wait for a response") %></h3>
          <p><%= _("While the authority works on the documents you requested, you can sit back. We will notify you by email when you get a response. In the meantime, you can read other requests our users have made.") %></p>
          <%= link_to _("Browse requests"), request_list_successful_path, class: "button-secondary" %>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="hiw-step">
        <div class="hiw-step__illustration" aria-hidden="true">
          <%= image_tag "illustrations/undraw_sharing-knowledge.svg", alt: "" %>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-step__content">
          <h3 class="hiw-step__title"><span class="hiw-step__num">3.</span> <%= _("Published and done") %></h3>
          <p><%= _("The answer is published online for everyone. Now you have your answer, and everybody else can access it too, contributing to public benefit and your right to know.") %></p>
          <%= link_to _("Search requests"), request_list_successful_path, class: "button-secondary" %>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

<%# Dark "learn more about how we work" band with the accent notch (booklet page 29) %>
<div class="homepage-learn-more ds-dark">
  <div class="row">
    <h2 class="learn-more__title"><%= _("Learn more about how we work") %></h2>
    <p class="learn-more__text">
      <%= _("Public records need to be easier to access, to contribute to the common good and give society value, for our right as citizens to know what happens with our tax money. Dive into how our entirely non-profit organisation works and handles the process of helping you make requests for public records. This is your right under the Freedom of the Press Act and the principle of public access dating back to 1766. We work to uphold it.") %>
    </p>
    <div class="learn-more__ctas">
      <%= link_to _("Learn more about us"), learn_path, class: "link_button_green" %>
      <%= link_to _("Support our work"), help_credits_path(:anchor => 'helpus'), class: "button-secondary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
